    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/0adbd0e8c700e1a8f4839165bcd9e825.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=100 /></span><br>Here has a rich variety of cards, and the deck can be matched to get different effects. Your Majesty need to choose the cards in each turn. Be a fearsome military power or a rich country? Your Majesty please order!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/2d604eeaf70053306f41322e4cb7f384.poster.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/2d604eeaf70053306f41322e4cb7f384.webm?t=1749545835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/228b7f65d8ec5b6c15156587fc609b32.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=100 /></span><br>The dynasty will also encounter many variables. Perhaps a rebel army is coming to attack, or a plague of locusts is plaguing the people. Your Majesty please use your wisdom to ward off the plague, destroy the rebels, and protect your people. You will be honoured for generation to generation!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/67be3f81158d649de8654c541e352323.poster.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/67be3f81158d649de8654c541e352323.webm?t=1749545835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/9a55e4ce34c22803ea6c9460fa32401c.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=100 /></span><br>To make the country rich and to repel foreign enemies, reasonable policies are indispensable. Your Majesty, please choose the cards to show the direction of the country's development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/ae1a3f41b83090dff36301264b6b9359.poster.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/ae1a3f41b83090dff36301264b6b9359.webm?t=1749545835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/2b538c66f8fb9ee47b834fc04ac604b2.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=100 /></span><br>Each card combination yields unexpected benefits; choosing the right cards will solidify your regime!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/c0e4619e089e81c6b245ecc9102f1bdc.poster.avif?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/c0e4619e089e81c6b245ecc9102f1bdc.webm?t=1749545835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164160/extras/57c348c6cdc97e79e579a16e2871046d.webp?t=1749545835\" width=610 height=50 /></span>",
